  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>LabelCreatingOutOfTheWorkplace</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>You can create the analysis option only from workplace &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Variants of the analysis of target indicators> Analysis options of target values&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>فقط می‌توانید گزینه تحلیل را از میز کار &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Variants of the analysis of target indicators> گزینه‌های تحلیل مقادیر هدف&lt;/> ایجاد کنید.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Создание варианта анализа возможно только из рабочего места &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Variants of the analysis of target indicators>Варианты анализа целевых показателей&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Analiz seçeneğinin oluşturulması sadece &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Variants of the analysis of target indicators>çalışma alanından mümkündür&lt;/>hedef göstergelerinin analiz seçenekleri.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Tạo một tùy chọn phân tích chỉ có thể từ nơi làm việc. &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Variants of the analysis of target indicators>Tùy chọn phân tích mục tiêu.&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>You can create the analysis option only from workplace &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Variants of the analysis of target indicators> Analysis options of target values&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>You can create the analysis option only from workplace &lt;link e1cib/list/Guide.Variants of the analysis of target indicators> Analysis options of target values&lt;/>.</value>
    </title>
